~ start
match PlayerStats.curr_level
	when "start"
		do play_cat()
		Max: Oh to be a cat and have the liberty to doze off all day.
		Max: Sleep well, Bart.
	when "messy_house"
		Max: How in the world did you manage to make this much of a mess???
		...: Unfortunately, Bart refuses to give you an answer.
		...: Possibilities flash through your mind. 
		...: Perhaps it is guilt. 
		...: Perhaps it is pride. 
		...: Perhaps he truly does not know the answer.
		...: Nay, his silence is from neither of these.
		...: It is because he is a cat.

=> END